<!--
  Every word of the app's own chrome. Card text is never here: it is written in whatever script the
  user's notes are in (see ScriptProfile), and only the buttons, labels and messages around it follow
  the app's language. values-hi/strings.xml must carry every name below - a missing one silently falls
  back to English, which reads as a half-translated app.
-->
<!-- PluralsCandidate is ignored deliberately: every count that changes form ("1 card", "2 cards")
     is a <plurals>; what is left are labels like "%1$d due" whose words never inflect. -->
